{"message":"Thanks, Mohamed. To look up your balances, please provide your user ID associated with your account. Once I have it, I’ll pull your payment methods and give you the total remaining balance for your gift cards and for your travel certificates.

For changing your upcoming reservation afterward, I’ll need your reservation ID and what you’d like to change (flights/dates, cabin, or bags). If you don’t know the reservation ID, I can find it once I have your user ID.

Please share your user ID to get started."}

